      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEMPTATION (8) broke through for her maiden win over 1100m at Gosford last time, scoring comfortably. Sparingly raced and has more to offer. YOU'RE THE CHOICE (4) has been thereabouts recently, the latest result a fifth beaten 1.75 lengths at Canterbury over 1250m. Will appreciate a drop in grade. Among the leading chances in this company. UNCERTAIN GLORY (3) returned from a break with a solid fourth, winding up late at the end of 1100m at Warwick Farm after settling well back. Will appreciate the extra 100m and can burst through late. HEY JUDE (5) is back at the races for the first time since March 21. Scored over 1200m at Nowra at the start of last prep. Looks a strong top-three prospect. TIGLETTA (6) returns and will be hoping to pick back up from where she left off last campaign. Two lead-up trials should have her forward enough to be very competitive.",
